1
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:34,920
Battalion Commander!

2
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,880
A fight broke out in the mess hall!

3
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,480
They're itching for a beating.

4
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,480
They just won't quit, will they?

5
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,320
Commander.

6
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,640
I'm sorry.

7
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,800
What are you apologizing for?

8
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,320
Before,

9
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,560
I misunderstood you

10
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:09,960
and treated you poorly.

11
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,000
I judged a better man

12
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,920
by my own petty standards.

13
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,000
You were right.

14
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,200
I just care too much about my pride.

15
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,800
I need to change that.

16
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,080
And I'm changing it right now.

17
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,000
Today, in front of everyone,

18
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,640
I formally apologize to you.

19
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:23,840
Commander,

20
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,240
I'm sorry.

21
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,400
Commander Guo,

22
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,200
I need to apologize to you too.

23
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:29,440
About what happened before, I...

24
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,200
Lin Yihu,

25
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,200
those cheap tricks of yours

26
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,560
I outgrew them long ago.

27
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,680
I'll teach you some advanced ones someday.

28
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,440
Commander,

29
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,200
we all apologize to you.

30
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,640
Commander,

31
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:42,440
we're sorry.

32
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:43,960
All right.

33
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,080
If you really want to apologize,

34
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,520
then train hard.

35
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,560
Make sure that in the Group Army's

36
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,080
live-fire exercise,

37
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,680
you bring me back first place.

38
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,800
Absolutely.

39
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,640
But that's not enough.

40
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,560
We're treating the Commander to

41
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:59,440
braised pork.

42
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,680
Battalion, attention!

43
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:04,800
Chow time!

44
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:05,680
Yeah!

45
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:09,680
Yeah!

46
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,320
Continue testing.

47
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:35,880
How is it going?

48
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,560
Is the research project going well?

49
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,040
It's going very smoothly.

50
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,400
I've been at the base for over two months now.

51
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:44,080
Plus the preparation I did at the academy,

52
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,760
I have basically no issues with the directing duties.

53
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,280
Next,

54
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,800
I still need to participate in actual operations

55
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,480
to gather more information

56
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,200
to support my

57
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:54,520
research project on the training base's

58
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,400
information platform.

59
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,560
Good.

60
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,680
If you have any needs while you're here,

61
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,760
just let me know.

62
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,360
After all, I am still your mentor.

63
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,200
I also hope that you

64
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,280
can use this research

65
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,560
to take our training base's information platform

66
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,720
and improve it.

67
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:09,960
That way,

68
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,640
in future exercises,

69
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,280
our directors

70
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,880
won't have to run around

71
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:15,960
and cover vast distances anymore.

72
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,120
Not only will it save them from running around,

73
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,080
we can also

74
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:21,200
monitor the entire exercise comprehensively.

75
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,280
This way,

76
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,680
it will help us make more scientific

77
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,080
and accurate evaluations and rulings.

78
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,680
Sir,

79
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,160
you just mentioned needs.

80
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,680
I do actually have one.

81
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:34,680
Tell me.

82
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,160
I hope you can arrange for me

83
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:37,880
to participate as much as possible

84
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:40,400
in exercises of various scales

85
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,120
to collect data

86
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:41,960
and accumulate experience.

87
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,440
Alright, no problem.

88
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,720
I'll give the group army's brigades a heads-up.

89
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,880
Whenever the opportunity is right,

90
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:49,080
I'll arrange for you to join.

91
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,360
Thank you, sir.

92
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:50,720
By the way,

93
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,280
the group army's upcoming

94
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,640
confrontation exercise between the 404th and 396th Brigades

95
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:57,360
will start very soon.

96
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:58,720
It's a rare opportunity.

97
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,160
You need to be prepared.

98
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,320
Understood.

99
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,040
Thank you, Chief.

100
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,680
Awesome, that was great.

101
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,800
Let's keep working hard together.

102
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,320
Keep it up, everyone.

103
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,440
You need to work hard too.

104
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:14,400
Will do!

105
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,320
How is it?

106
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,800
Compared to this,

107
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,120
is the gap still big?

108
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,400
Instructor, sir!

109
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,200
Compared to the whole army's standard,

110
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,200
aside from the squad leader,

111
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,480
we still need to catch up.

112
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,160
But as for the group army's standard,

113
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,280
we have a chance to meet it.

114
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:29,880
Look at all of you.

115
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,840
You all look so energetic.

116
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:34,320
This week's results shocked me when they came out.

117
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,720
I thought you guys would be exhausted.

118
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,360
I didn't expect

119
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,760
every single one of you to be so full of life.

120
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,000
In this exercise,

121
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,680
you must be the dark horse.

122
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,600
Yes, sir!

123
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,360
Tell me,

124
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,080
what are your plans after the research project ends?

125
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,800
My graduate advisor, Professor Zhang,

126
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,520
recommended a research institute in Beijing to me.

127
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:56,640
That old Zhang...

128
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,920
What kind of misguided direction is he pointing you in?

129
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,680
I was hoping you'd stay here.

130
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,480
What?

131
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,960
Have you already made up your mind?

132
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,400
I personally feel that

133
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,600
the software and hardware facilities at the institute,

134
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:10,760
as well as the research atmosphere,

135
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:11,400
align quite well with

136
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,160
my personal career plans.

137
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:14,760
I get it.

138
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,800
You're saying the conditions in our theater command army

139
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,320
aren't grand enough for a big shot like you.

140
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:18,800
Understood.

141
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:19,880
No, no.

142
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:21,560
Actually, there's a more important reason.

143
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,480
My mother...

144
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,840
Her heart isn't doing very well,

145
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,040
so if I

146
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,960
live in Beijing,

147
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,120
I can be a bit closer to home.

148
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,000
Alright, alright.

149
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,440
It's not like I'm criticizing you.

150
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,800
Going to the research institute is actually quite good.

151
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,600
In the future, if there are good projects

152
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,320
or research topics,

153
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,520
we can still collaborate with each other.

154
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,280
Of course.

155
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:40,880
Old Jiang.

156
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:44,080
In this upcoming group army combat exercise,

157
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:46,080
your Second Battalion must be the main force.

158
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,600
Section Chief Liu,

159
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,280
where you sit determines where you stand.

160
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:52,880
Once

161
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,160
you became the Chief of Operations and Training,

162
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:55,880
you immediately stopped competing with me.

163
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,680
What kind of talk is that?

164
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,040
Even if we compete,

165
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,000
we're still close friends.

166
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:00,520
Right?

167
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,320
I'm worried that Guo Zijian is unreliable.

168
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,240
Did you forget about the time those two company commanders fought?

169
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,560
It made Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

170
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,600
so mad that he's still grinding his teeth over it.

171
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,600
But I heard

172
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,240
that the First Battalion's recent training

173
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,720
has been pretty solid.

174
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,520
Come on. With him?

175
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,440
All he does is for show.

176
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,640
If the main attack battalion position is handed to him,

177
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,320
then we're really doomed.

178
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,080
We shouldn't underestimate him too much, either.

179
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,480
What's going on with you today?

180
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,640
You seem so unsettled.

181
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,520
Focusing on the troops' foundational training

182
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,600
is a real test of hard skills.

183
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,400
Section Chief Liu,

184
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,640
you're right.

185
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,320
Have you forgotten a few years ago,

186
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:44,520
when I left my staff officer post to be a battalion commander?

187
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,480
All I wanted was to surpass you.

188
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,760
But after competing for two years,

189
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,800
I just couldn't gain

190
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,240
a single advantage over you.

191
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,880
So when it comes to managing training,

192
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,320
if you claim to be second,

193
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,480
no one dares to claim first.

194
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,640
What are you looking at?

195
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,480
Section Chief Liu.

196
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,640
Section Chief Liu.

197
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,560
Back when you were the battalion commander,

198
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,520
these words...

199
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,640
Why didn't you say them to me, Jiang Shengqiang?

200
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,920
We were competitors back then.

201
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,000
How could I admit that?

202
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,680
It's not too late to say it now.

203
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:22,520
Rest assured.

204
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,120
Whatever the brigade arranges,

205
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,280
I, Jiang Shengqiang,

206
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,240
will execute accordingly.

207
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,200
I'm telling you,

208
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,840
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo's exact words were,

209
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,080
"When it comes to military matters,

210
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,440
handing them over to your Second Battalion

211
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,720
puts the entire brigade at ease."

212
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:35,560
Understood.

213
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,760
How does it feel being back in the First Company?

214
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,400
Do you even have to ask?

215
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:44,760
It feels absolutely fantastic.

216
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,440
I won't get talked about behind my back anymore.

217
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,640
Is that all you care about?

218
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:57,000
You leaders might not know this,

219
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,120
but we're all in the same compound.

220
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,720
We know every door and every face.

221
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:03,480
If the punishment is too light,

222
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,160
it doesn't meet the standards.

223
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,200
If it's too harsh,

224
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,320
I get cursed out everywhere.

225
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:10,000
Serving as battalion staff officer these past two months,

226
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:13,360
and being specially in charge of the Blue Force squad,

227
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:16,000
what little good rep I, Li Songwei, had saved up

228
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,760
has been completely ruined.

229
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,240
With your shitty temper,

230
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,600
what good rep?

231
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,120
Tell me,

232
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:23,720
what have you gained these past two months?

233
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,640
I have gained some things,

234
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,440
especially in tactical proficiency.

235
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,560
If we were to compete again this time,

236
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,240
I might not lose to you.

237
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,320
This is bad! Bad news!

238
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,120
What are you doing?

239
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,360
Always yelling "bad news" all day.

240
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:37,920
No.

241
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,160
Can't you say something auspicious?

242
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:40,040
Speak.

243
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:40,480
Company Commander!

244
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,200
What is it?

245
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:42,800
I heard from my buddy

246
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:44,600
that our brigade is giving the main attack battalion spot

247
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,200
to the 2nd Battalion!

248
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:46,760
What?

249
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,120
Who did you hear this from?

250
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:51,680
Is the information accurate?

251
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,000
It shouldn't be wrong.

252
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,760
My buddy is in the training and operations branch.

253
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,520
He must have heard it from Liu Wangyuan.

254
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,560
That scheming Liu.

255
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:01,400
He must be playing dirty tricks behind our backs again.

256
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,960
I think his two years as battalion commander

257
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,920
have been a waste.

258
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,000
Where are you going?

259
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,240
To protest to the deputy brigade commander and commissar.

260
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:08,960
Halt!

261
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:11,760
But...

262
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:13,560
Battalion Commander,

263
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,960
are we just going to let it go?

264
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:16,080
Recently,

265
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,040
we've put in so much blood, sweat, and tears!

266
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,160
We finally get a chance to show what we can do.

267
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,720
If we really become the reserve,

268
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,040
what's the point?

269
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,680
I know what to do about this.

270
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:27,560
The main attack battalion,

271
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:28,920
we won't give it up.

272
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:34,960
As for our opponent in this drill,

273
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:36,680
the 404th Brigade,

274
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,640
I don't think I need to say much.

275
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,320
You all know them, right?

276
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,000
Who doesn't?

277
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:43,880
The Crash Brigade.

278
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,920
What do you mean by Crash Brigade?

279
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,200
Back when the internet was slow,

280
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:50,400
whenever we got a white screen,

281
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,320
a "404" would pop up.

282
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,160
Everyone thought the computer had crashed.

283
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:55,320
However,

284
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:57,720
their brigade has another name.

285
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,400
They're called the Black Mamba.

286
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:00,880
That's right.

287
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,720
The Black Mamba.

288
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:04,960
The commander of the 404th Brigade

289
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,120
named them that himself.

290
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,880
What is a black mamba?

291
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,040
Jiang Shengqiang!

292
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,360
Here!

293
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,920
Explain it to everyone.

294
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:14,920
Yes, sir!

295
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:16,880
The black mamba

296
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,400
is a type of cobra.

297
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,320
It's the most terrifying venomous snake in Africa.

298
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,840
Its slithering speed

299
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,480
is the fastest among all snakes in the world.

300
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,200
Most importantly,

301
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,000
its venom

302
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:29,160
contains lethal neurotoxins

303
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,120
and cardiotoxins.

304
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:32,280
Once attacked by it,

305
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,600
you will face

306
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,200
damage to your vital organs.

307
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:38,000
The 404th Brigade's strikes against opponents,

308
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,040
its tactics,

309
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:39,840
and combat methods

310
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,360
are just like the black mamba.

311
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:42,960
Report finished.

312
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:45,440
Did everyone understand?

313
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:52,280
Comrade Jiang Shengqiang is right.

314
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,640
Commander of the 404th Brigade, Long Yuanshan,

315
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,880
has two biggest hobbies during exercises.

316
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:58,960
One is

317
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,040
crippling the Red Army's nervous system.

318
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:01,920
The second

319
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:04,000
is capturing Red Army commanders.

320
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,800
So, this time,

321
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:09,080
we must ensure Deputy Commander Suo's safety.

322
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,040
If he gets captured,

323
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,200
we'll basically only have

324
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,400
to raise the white flag.

325
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:18,400
My life is in your hands.

326
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:20,640
Report.

327
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:21,880
Speak.

328
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,400
Rest assured, Commissar.

329
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:24,360
Our battalion

330
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:26,000
can take on both the main attack

331
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,560
and the task of protecting the commander

332
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,360
at the same time.

333
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:30,440
We will absolutely ensure his safety.

334
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,880
The 2nd Battalion is our

335
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,600
veteran main attack battalion.

336
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,200
So this time,

337
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,440
for the main attack,

338
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,400
it has to be the 2nd Battalion.

339
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:40,880
We guarantee to complete the mission.

340
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:43,320
Report.

341
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,000
I object.

342
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:50,640
What?

343
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:54,640
Commander Guo wants to snatch the main attack from our 2nd Battalion?

344
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,480
How can you call it snatching?

345
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,760
According to the organizational structure,

346
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,040
the 1st Battalion

347
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:02,040
should also be a main attack battalion.

348
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:03,560
Commander Guo,

349
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,200
I want to remind you,

350
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,000
the position of the main attack battalion

351
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:08,240
belongs to the most capable.

352
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,120
It's not based on organizational structure.

353
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,600
As for your 1st Battalion,

354
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:15,240
the level of your training scores in each subject,

355
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,520
I don't need to say more, right?

356
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,400
If I remember correctly,

357
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:23,680
last time,

358
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,880
you were defeated by our 2nd Battalion.

359
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,280
Well said, Commander Jiang.

360
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:30,840
It belongs to the most capable.

361
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,400
But who is capable

362
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:34,360
depends not on past records,

363
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:35,760
but on current ones.

364
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,040
You mean

365
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,400
you want to compete with our 2nd Battalion again?

366
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,240
Of course.

367
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:43,720
That's still more convincing

368
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:44,880
than a predetermined decision.

369
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,240
Alright, alright, alright.

370
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:53,440
Save this competitive spirit of yours

371
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,680
and direct it at Long Yuanshan.

372
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,760
The meeting just started,

373
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:58,840
and all I hear is you two interrupting.

374
00:14:58,920 --> 00:14:59,280
Sit down.

375
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,680
Let's continue the meeting.

376
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,520
This Guo Zijian...

377
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:09,560
The fact that he wants to fight for the main attack battalion...

378
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:10,360
who doesn't know about it?

379
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:12,520
He just wants to score some impression points

380
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:14,440
to gain leverage to enter the higher command.

381
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:16,400
He's too driven by personal gain.

382
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,400
He wants to advance his career.

383
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:20,600
There's nothing wrong with that.

384
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:23,680
But everything must follow a proper procedure.

385
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:25,400
Nothing can be accomplished without rules.

386
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,040
An exercise is a major event.

387
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:30,480
We can't joke around with the 396th Brigade's honor.

388
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,400
Logically, regarding the main attack battalion,

389
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:34,200
our brigade could make the decision directly.

390
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:36,400
There's no need to listen to the two battalions' opinions.

391
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:37,880
But today,

392
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,600
he publicly raised objections.

393
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:41,520
If we outright refuse him,

394
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:44,000
and it reaches the ears of the army commanders,

395
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,360
won't it make us look like

396
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:46,920
we're deliberately sidelining him?

397
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,760
What do you have in mind?

398
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,920
Didn't we judge the 1st Battalion as the loser last time?

399
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,400
In his heart, Guo Zijian

400
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:57,400
must be bottling up his frustration.

401
00:15:58,320 --> 00:16:00,400
Since he actively challenged the 2nd Battalion again this time,

402
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:01,440
I think

403
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,880
we might as well let the two battalions

404
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,880
face off again

405
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,120
and have a comprehensive competition.

406
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:06,320
For one thing,

407
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,800
it can serve as

408
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,200
a warm-up for our exercise.

409
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:10,360
For another,

410
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,760
it will thoroughly convince him

411
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,360
and let him know the 396th Brigade

412
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,600
isn't a place where he can do

413
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,720
whatever he pleases.

414
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,000
That sounds good.

415
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,640
It's relatively fair.

416
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,520
Later, I'll talk to the commissar

417
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:24,520
and report this to him.

418
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,440
For today's mobilization meeting,

419
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,240
I'll kick things off,

420
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:32,680
and later the political instructor

421
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,640
will give his instructions.

422
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,960
Why are we holding this mobilization?

423
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:38,400
To tell everyone,

424
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,240
this isn't an exercise,

425
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:41,520
nor a battle,

426
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:44,520
but a face-off match.

427
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:50,120
Some of you might already know.

428
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,280
That's right.

429
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,200
We're going to face off against the 2nd Battalion

430
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,840
to compete for the role of

431
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,480
the main attack battalion in this force-on-force exercise.

432
00:17:12,119 --> 00:17:12,839
What?

433
00:17:13,319 --> 00:17:15,160
Have you been beaten into fear by Battalion 2?

434
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:17,359
Beaten so badly you lost your backbone?

435
00:17:17,560 --> 00:17:18,599
No!

436
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:19,599
Good.

437
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:22,319
It seems you still admit you're men.

438
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,839
Real men.

439
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,119
And still worthy of the

440
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:27,119
proudly

441
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,560
written word "soldier".

442
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,560
I don't believe

443
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,280
that what Battalion 2 can do,

444
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,360
our Battalion 1 cannot do.

445
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,400
Those drills

446
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:39,560
they trained for,

447
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,960
we haven't missed either.

448
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:43,720
Although we lost last time,

449
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:47,400
over these past few months,

450
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,880
I've witnessed your training firsthand.

451
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:50,960
You've made great progress.

452
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:54,000
I can responsibly tell you all,

453
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:55,640
now is exactly the time for us

454
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,520
to let our strength do the talking.

455
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:03,440
Since you all chose to be soldiers,

456
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,440
when push comes to shove,

457
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,320
take the word "courage" in your hearts

458
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,920
and make it real.

459
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:11,160
Make it tough.

460
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:13,320
Etch it into your bones.

461
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,080
Etch it into your blood.

462
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,760
I'll just ask you one thing now.

463
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,720
Do you have the confidence

464
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,360
to defeat Battalion 2?

465
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:32,800
Yes! Yes! Yes!

466
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,040
Of course,

467
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:37,120
strategically we should despise our opponent,

468
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,240
but tactically,

469
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,320
we must study them carefully.

470
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:42,800
As for how exactly to study them,

471
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:43,480
I don't care.

472
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,000
I just have one demand.

473
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,600
We must win.

474
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,040
Now,

475
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:50,400
I invite the Political Instructor to give his instructions.

476
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:51,880
Guo Zijian.

477
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,760
It's a pity he's a battalion commander.

478
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,160
He should be head of the propaganda department.

479
00:18:56,520 --> 00:18:57,360
His eloquence

480
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:58,560
is really something else.

481
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,160
Morale is good.

482
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,120
We can't slack off either.

483
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:04,120
Don't worry, Commander.

484
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,720
The brothers in our battalion

485
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:07,000
have been itching for a fight

486
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,200
and want to go all out.

487
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:10,600
We cannot lose to Guo Zijian.

488
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:13,880
Absolutely not.

489
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:15,120
Yes, sir.

490
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,840
The mobilization meeting the Commander held today

491
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:24,240
was very well done.

492
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:27,520
It made me, Sang Haitian, feel extremely ashamed.

493
00:19:29,560 --> 00:19:31,760
Originally, I wanted to talk to everyone

494
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:34,080
about the competition,

495
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:36,520
and say that winning or losing doesn't matter.

496
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,280
Therefore,

497
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,040
today,

498
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:42,320
I want to stand here

499
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,960
in front of all officers and soldiers of Battalion 1,

500
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,240
and make a self-criticism.

501
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,560
We are the people's soldiers.

502
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:53,200
Our duty

503
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:55,680
is to defend our country

504
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,960
and protect our compatriots.

505
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,400
If in our minds,

506
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:04,320
we let the word "lose" take root,

507
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:05,800
then how can we

508
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:08,200
still go to the battlefield and fight?

509
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,640
We can't!

510
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:10,600
Exactly.

511
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:12,440
Therefore,

512
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:14,800
in this competition,

513
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:17,320
there is only one word:

514
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:18,480
Win!

515
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:21,080
Win! Win! Win!

516
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:36,800
We're nearing the end,

517
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:38,880
and the scores are still neck and neck.

518
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:40,200
It's really weird.

519
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,920
Battalion 1 has improved incredibly fast.

520
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:44,240
It's like they became the main battalion overnight.

521
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,200
You guys have no idea.

522
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,160
Lately, Battalion Commander Guo

523
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:49,280
has put serious effort into training.

524
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:53,400
All right.

525
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,080
You guys keep an eye on things here.

526
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:57,520
Yes, sir.

527
00:20:58,600 --> 00:20:59,560
These two battalion commanders

528
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:00,920
sure are interesting.

529
00:21:01,120 --> 00:21:03,040
One is at the very front, the other at the very back.

530
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:04,840
It's a shame.

531
00:21:05,120 --> 00:21:07,000
The team score is based on the average.

532
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:09,280
19 minutes and eight seconds.

533
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:34,400
Hold the weapon with one hand.

534
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,400
Reload in a standing position.

535
00:21:41,120 --> 00:21:42,520
Good.

536
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:45,200
Prepare to fire.

537
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:10,680
Prone position, load.

538
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:17,840
Commence firing.

539
00:22:37,600 --> 00:22:38,360
For both sides,

540
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,920
the result of the first match:

541
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:40,760
1st Battalion

542
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:41,880
leads by five rings.

543
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:42,880
Awesome!

544
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:47,360
I object to the match results.

545
00:22:51,520 --> 00:22:52,160
Sir!

546
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:55,520
Every rifle used by 1st Battalion in the shooting match

547
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:57,400
was equipped with a new type of scope.

548
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:00,040
They won the match using the new scopes.

549
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:01,280
I believe

550
00:23:01,280 --> 00:23:02,400
it was an unfair victory.

551
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:04,640
Issuing new equipment and not using it,

552
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:07,000
should we just let it collect dust in the warehouse?

553
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:08,480
That's just stupid.

554
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,040
Besides,

555
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:12,680
the training syllabus states

556
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:13,960
that in shooting assessments and matches,

557
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,120
scopes can be used

558
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,160
and the evaluation criteria remain unchanged.

559
00:23:17,760 --> 00:23:18,520
If you don't believe me,

560
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:20,080
you can go back and check.

561
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:21,160
Commander Guo,

562
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:23,840
are you playing word games with me?

563
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,600
We operated strictly according to

564
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:27,720
the regulations of the training syllabus.

565
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:28,960
Commander Jiang,

566
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:31,320
These new scopes

567
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:32,760
were distributed to the troops a long time ago.

568
00:23:33,040 --> 00:23:33,960
Including your 2nd Battalion.

569
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:34,960
If you don't use them,

570
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:36,040
you can't forbid others from using them.

571
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,280
That makes no sense, right?

572
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:38,920
Commander.

573
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:41,760
The new scopes were just issued recently.

574
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:44,560
Our battalion has barely trained with them,

575
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:45,760
so...

576
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:46,960
Staff Officer Zhou.

577
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:47,800
Here!

578
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:48,440
Speak up!

579
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:50,480
Section Chief Liu said

580
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:52,160
we need to ensure the equipment remains in good condition.

581
00:23:52,760 --> 00:23:53,320
So...

582
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:55,000
So?

583
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:57,040
I told you to ensure they remain in good condition,

584
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,720
not to stop you from training!

585
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:00,440
Well said, Section Chief Liu.

586
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,560
Do you still think it's unfair?

587
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,480
If you still feel it's unfair,

588
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:07,280
the last round doesn't have to count.

589
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:09,440
You can use the new scopes too.

590
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:10,600
We'll have another match.

591
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:11,360
How about that?

592
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:13,320
Commander,

593
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:14,920
we haven't specifically trained

594
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:16,160
to use the new scopes.

595
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:17,240
Even if we compete...

596
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:17,720
I get it.

597
00:24:19,120 --> 00:24:20,440
We're all just trying to do our jobs here.

598
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:23,040
If 2nd Battalion has no objections

599
00:24:23,040 --> 00:24:24,080
to the results of this round,

600
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:25,440
then we'll proceed

601
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,200
to the next event.

602
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:33,280
Jiang Shengqiang.

603
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:34,040
Here!

604
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,320
Do you accept the results?

605
00:24:39,760 --> 00:24:40,400
I accept them.

606
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:43,880
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

607
00:24:44,600 --> 00:24:46,560
the process of using these new scopes

608
00:24:46,560 --> 00:24:48,000
is indeed quite cumbersome.

609
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:49,960
They require repeated calibration.

610
00:24:50,840 --> 00:24:52,920
Plus, their structure is quite delicate,

611
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:55,400
making them difficult to repair once broken.

612
00:24:56,120 --> 00:24:58,360
Since the new scopes were issued,

613
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:01,160
it's understandable they arranged training.

614
00:25:01,560 --> 00:25:02,080
Yes.

615
00:25:02,080 --> 00:25:03,400
It is understandable.

616
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:04,320
However,

617
00:25:04,560 --> 00:25:05,480
don't forget that

618
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:06,800
regarding the equipment,

619
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:09,000
we have evaluation standards every year.

620
00:25:09,720 --> 00:25:11,200
If we fail the evaluation this year,

621
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,520
it will affect our brigade's

622
00:25:12,760 --> 00:25:14,560
overall ranking in the entire group army.

623
00:25:21,320 --> 00:25:22,480
Speaking of shooting,

624
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:23,640
I heard that Guo Zijian

625
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:24,960
at the 396th Brigade's

626
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:26,040
competition

627
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:28,280
used a new type of scope.

628
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,400
That really put your Training Department on the spot.

629
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:33,400
Yes, sir.

630
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:35,360
After this new scope was issued,

631
00:25:35,840 --> 00:25:36,760
we considered that

632
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:38,600
the troops hadn't received specialized training yet.

633
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:40,320
Plus, the training syllabus

634
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:41,960
didn't have mandatory regulations,

635
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,240
so we

636
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,000
for the various units

637
00:25:44,120 --> 00:25:45,520
didn't set explicit requirements.

638
00:25:46,800 --> 00:25:47,680
Right now, many of our comrades

639
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:48,920
are still very complacent.

640
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:51,240
They're terrified of taking on extra responsibilities.

641
00:25:51,800 --> 00:25:53,440
They dodge and hide whenever possible.

642
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:55,800
For things that superiors

643
00:25:56,200 --> 00:25:57,520
don't explicitly demand,

644
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,640
they've basically given up on

645
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:01,000
trial and error and innovation.

646
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:03,920
The more work you do,

647
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:05,760
the more trouble you get into.

648
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:08,680
Guo Zijian utilizing the new scope

649
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:10,640
is like a thorn.

650
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,160
It might not seem sharp,

651
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:14,680
but its edge is undeniable.

652
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:18,440
That will make a lot of people uncomfortable.

653
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:20,240
You're right, sir.

654
00:26:20,600 --> 00:26:21,800
Even as the Chief of Training,

655
00:26:21,960 --> 00:26:22,880
I feel quite uncomfortable about it.

656
00:26:24,760 --> 00:26:25,320
But fortunately,

657
00:26:25,560 --> 00:26:28,360
we are already planning specialized training.

658
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:31,080
Of course, it sounds like hindsight now,

659
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:33,480
but it's indeed already in motion.

660
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,400
Many comrades in our headquarters right now

661
00:26:39,560 --> 00:26:41,880
are rushing around but getting nowhere.

662
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:45,240
They say work must be procedural,

663
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,880
procedures must be standardized,

664
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:48,600
and standards must be rational.

665
00:26:48,600 --> 00:26:50,040
It makes every task feel like passing the buck.

666
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:52,360
As for your Operations and Training Section,

667
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:53,720
although the issue isn't glaring,

668
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,320
you should still take it as a warning.

669
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:56,720
You're right to criticize us, sir.

670
00:26:58,280 --> 00:26:59,120
Sir,

671
00:26:59,120 --> 00:27:00,480
I'm increasingly realizing that with Guo Zijian,

672
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:02,080
transferring him from the Infantry Academy

673
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:03,760
was an absolute masterstroke.

674
00:27:04,280 --> 00:27:05,440
You really have an eye for talent.

675
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,600
Whether it's a masterstroke or a blunder

676
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:08,360
is still uncertain.

677
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,480
Let time be the judge of that.

678
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:12,120
However,

679
00:27:12,600 --> 00:27:13,400
Guo Zijian really is

680
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,400
a precious asset to my old classmate.

681
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:18,560
I went to great lengths to poach him

682
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,520
and sent him to the 1st Battalion to gain experience.

683
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:24,040
It was a very deliberate move.

684
00:27:25,120 --> 00:27:26,120
Here, have some tea.

685
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:26,640
Thanks.

686
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:29,240
Old classmate,

687
00:27:30,720 --> 00:27:33,600
ever since Guo Zijian made his self-criticism on stage,

688
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:35,200
I could tell

689
00:27:35,760 --> 00:27:36,840
you had your eyes on him.

690
00:27:37,760 --> 00:27:40,080
What, you don't trust him with me?

691
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:43,560
You have no idea.

692
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:46,800
When it comes to Guo Zijian,

693
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:48,560
our academy had already

694
00:27:48,560 --> 00:27:50,400
started a key training program for him.

695
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:53,720
And we've even coordinated with

696
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:54,920
the relevant army aviation and special ops brigades.

697
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,240
If Section Chief Liu hadn't

698
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:59,840
escalated this to our academy's party committee,

699
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,280
trying to get Guo Zijian transferred,

700
00:28:02,560 --> 00:28:03,720
I would never have agreed to this.

701
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,160
All right, I admit it.

702
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,760
I got a great bargain, okay?

703
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:09,880
All right.

704
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:12,280
Let's stop talking about Guo Zijian.

705
00:28:13,160 --> 00:28:14,240
I just hope,

706
00:28:15,280 --> 00:28:16,120
old classmate,

707
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:17,760
now that Guo Zijian is with you,

708
00:28:18,640 --> 00:28:19,400
you'll temper him well.

709
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,080
Don't worry, old classmate.

710
00:28:23,800 --> 00:28:24,440
And one more thing.

711
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:27,480
If one day you feel

712
00:28:28,240 --> 00:28:30,360
he's no longer useful or you don't want him,

713
00:28:31,440 --> 00:28:32,960
just return him directly to me.

714
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,520
What do you mean?

715
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:38,920
This kid is a talent, and he shouldn't go to waste.

716
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:43,000
All right, I'll keep your words in mind.

717
00:28:46,080 --> 00:28:48,040
To be honest, in just these past few months,

718
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:49,320
he's withstood pressure from all sides

719
00:28:49,520 --> 00:28:50,280
and managed to lead the 1st Battalion

720
00:28:50,280 --> 00:28:51,320
to a draw against the 2nd Battalion.

721
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:52,400
That counts as passing the test.

722
00:28:53,280 --> 00:28:54,760
Sir, I'm going to be shameless

723
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:56,040
and ask you a small favor.

724
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,080
As for Guo Zijian,

725
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,720
our Operations and Training Section wants to reserve him.

726
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,400
It's too early for that.

727
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,560
He hasn't even secured the main attack battalion yet, has he?

728
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:04,520
That being said,

729
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:07,160
these two battalions are evenly matched right now.

730
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:09,480
As for what the final result will be,

731
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:10,960
it's really hard to predict.

732
00:29:11,800 --> 00:29:12,840
Since this is a competition,

733
00:29:13,040 --> 00:29:16,000
it shouldn't be limited to meters, seconds, and points,

734
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:16,880
these kinds of rigid metrics.

735
00:29:17,640 --> 00:29:18,400
If they're going to compete,

736
00:29:19,080 --> 00:29:22,120
they need to show a unit's true level of combat readiness.

737
00:29:23,320 --> 00:29:24,960
Sir, do you mean...

738
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:31,360
Guo Zijian,

739
00:29:31,920 --> 00:29:32,680
no matter how much

740
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:34,240
training you've added to the 1st Battalion,

741
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:37,560
a military's combat readiness

742
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:40,800
cannot be built overnight.

743
00:29:42,280 --> 00:29:42,760
I admit

744
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:45,960
your little tricks worked on me.

745
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,480
But against the Black Mamba,

746
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,240
I'm sorry,

747
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:50,160
they are completely useless.

748
00:29:51,800 --> 00:29:53,120
Your little tricks

749
00:29:54,040 --> 00:29:56,560
will only push the 396th Brigade into the abyss of defeat.

750
00:29:58,520 --> 00:30:00,120
You're pretty good at kissing up.

751
00:30:01,560 --> 00:30:02,360
Let me tell you,

752
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:04,560
all warfare is based on deception.

753
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:07,200
War isn't just about fists,

754
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,400
it's also about brains.

755
00:30:09,040 --> 00:30:12,360
Modern warfare relies on equipment, information,

756
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:13,720
and the comprehensive use of multiple elements.

757
00:30:15,040 --> 00:30:15,880
I don't care if you say

758
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:17,280
it's a little trick or whatever,

759
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:19,440
I just know that to win,

760
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:22,000
we have to do whatever it takes.

761
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,600
All right, stop arguing.

762
00:30:24,680 --> 00:30:26,480
We didn't call you here to listen to you bicker.

763
00:30:27,040 --> 00:30:28,360
Since it's a tie now,

764
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:30,560
and neither of you will back down,

765
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:32,320
the commanders' idea is

766
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:34,640
to raise the stakes for the next round.

767
00:30:37,520 --> 00:30:38,040
Guo Zijian,

768
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:40,920
are you sure you want to continue?

769
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,400
Continue.

770
00:30:43,320 --> 00:30:43,960
Why not?

771
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,120
Then I will now announce

772
00:30:46,120 --> 00:30:47,360
the details of the next round.

773
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:50,280
This is a competition scenario

774
00:30:50,320 --> 00:30:51,480
designed based on your ideas.

775
00:30:52,360 --> 00:30:53,760
The 1st and 2nd Battalions will respectively

776
00:30:53,760 --> 00:30:55,880
head toward our pre-set target points.

777
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:58,120
Along the way, we will set up

778
00:30:58,120 --> 00:30:59,640
various obstacles of differing difficulties.

779
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,080
Based on their time of arrival

780
00:31:01,120 --> 00:31:02,920
and ability to handle obstacles,

781
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,520
we will comprehensively evaluate their scores.

782
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:05,640
The higher score wins.

783
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:06,560
Good.

784
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:09,600
Although this is just a competition between two battalions,

785
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,560
I will still request

786
00:31:11,560 --> 00:31:14,080
your tactical training base to participate in directing it.

787
00:31:15,080 --> 00:31:16,520
You organized a small-scale confrontation

788
00:31:16,520 --> 00:31:18,200
between the 1st and 2nd Battalions last time,

789
00:31:18,720 --> 00:31:19,760
so you have some experience.

790
00:31:20,520 --> 00:31:22,160
I've already spoken with Commander Ma.

791
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:24,680
You will lead the team again this time.

792
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:27,040
Yes, sir.

793
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:28,480
I guarantee to complete the mission.

794
00:31:35,280 --> 00:31:36,760
I came up with the test this time.

795
00:31:37,480 --> 00:31:38,560
Since the directing team is here,

796
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:41,200
I will just be a spectator the whole time.

797
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,720
I won't comment,

798
00:31:42,800 --> 00:31:43,640
I won't score,

799
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:44,720
and I won't take sides.

800
00:31:45,400 --> 00:31:47,480
So don't feel any pressure.

801
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:51,520
After decades of being a soldier,

802
00:31:52,360 --> 00:31:53,560
my favorite thing is watching military competitions.

803
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:56,000
You've set up such a great stage,

804
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:57,720
you should have informed me earlier.

805
00:31:58,880 --> 00:32:00,320
To watch the competition, the Chief

806
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:01,800
canceled two events

807
00:32:02,360 --> 00:32:03,520
and came with the Corps Commander's special approval.

808
00:32:05,560 --> 00:32:07,760
Thank you, Chief, for your deep affection for our 396th Brigade.

809
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:09,360
Commander Guo Zijian of the 1st Battalion

810
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:11,200
is still in the breaking-in period with his unit.

811
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:12,680
Commander Jiang Shengqiang of the 2nd Battalion

812
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:13,840
still needs more training.

813
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:16,200
I hope they live up to your expectations, Chief.

814
00:32:18,840 --> 00:32:20,360
Regarding the previous competition,

815
00:32:21,040 --> 00:32:22,120
what are your thoughts?

816
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:25,560
Report, Chief. Our deepest impression is that

817
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:27,080
the troops' morale has gone up,

818
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:29,400
and a combat atmosphere has emerged.

819
00:32:31,040 --> 00:32:33,160
My feeling is that this Guo Zijian

820
00:32:33,760 --> 00:32:36,080
has really ignited the fire in the 1st Battalion.

821
00:32:38,080 --> 00:32:40,800
It's only been a few days, don't speak too soon.

822
00:32:44,240 --> 00:32:47,000
The real contest has just begun.

823
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:09,280
I didn't expect that before the army group exercise started,

824
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:11,520
we'd already run into this Guo Zijian twice.

825
00:33:13,320 --> 00:33:14,160
I heard that recently

826
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:15,440
he has the 1st Battalion fired up.

827
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,440
I wonder if they can win this time.

828
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:23,080
The 2nd Battalion Commander, Jiang Shengqiang,

829
00:33:23,080 --> 00:33:25,240
has been the army group's model commander for two years.

830
00:33:26,080 --> 00:33:28,000
For the past three years, the 2nd Battalion's gold medal count

831
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:30,320
has ranked first in the 396th Brigade.

832
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:32,640
The 1st Battalion's recent record is far worse than the 2nd's.

833
00:33:32,840 --> 00:33:34,080
In the last confrontation,

834
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:36,040
their performance was even more disappointing.

835
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,760
But Guo Zijian is a variable.

836
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:40,640
We don't have enough data to support this yet,

837
00:33:40,880 --> 00:33:42,160
so we can't deduce the result.

838
00:33:43,640 --> 00:33:44,280
Staff Officer Liang.

839
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,120
I always thought

840
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:47,920
I was the biggest gossip on our base.

841
00:33:50,080 --> 00:33:50,760
Who knew...

842
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:52,080
How can this be called gossip?

843
00:33:52,640 --> 00:33:54,280
This is just some basic information.

844
00:33:54,520 --> 00:33:55,120
Basic?

845
00:33:56,320 --> 00:33:57,320
Don't tell me you checked all of their previous

846
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:59,000
combat information?

847
00:33:59,560 --> 00:34:00,200
Shouldn't I?

848
00:34:01,080 --> 00:34:02,760
And their daily training records.

849
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:03,920
These all help

850
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:05,560
make the competition plan more reasonable.

851
00:34:08,120 --> 00:34:09,000
After all, last time,

852
00:34:09,679 --> 00:34:10,719
when making the plan,

853
00:34:10,719 --> 00:34:11,760
I overlooked some issues.

854
00:34:12,639 --> 00:34:14,280
That's why when it came to the final judgment,

855
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:15,320
there was ambiguity.

856
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,120
This mobilization,

857
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:19,560
although there's no confrontation segment,

858
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:23,120
is actually a confrontation every second.

859
00:34:24,159 --> 00:34:24,480
Report!

860
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:27,880
Commander, it's only about 200 kilometers round trip.

861
00:34:28,199 --> 00:34:28,760
It's a piece of cake.

862
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:30,159
Li Songwei!

863
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:31,239
Here!

864
00:34:31,880 --> 00:34:32,920
You think you're so smart, huh?

865
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:36,679
I'm telling you all,

866
00:34:37,040 --> 00:34:38,760
Deputy Commander Liang wouldn't go to such lengths

867
00:34:39,639 --> 00:34:41,639
just to check our mobilization

868
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:42,840
and long-range raid capabilities.

869
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:46,400
Everyone needs to be on high alert.

870
00:34:46,719 --> 00:34:47,440
Do you hear me?

871
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:48,440
Yes, sir!

872
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:53,440
Report! The 2nd Battalion has already set off.

873
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:54,080
Good.

874
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:55,320
Staff Officer Hu!

875
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:55,840
Here!

876
00:34:55,920 --> 00:34:57,160
Contact Wu Dongsheng immediately.

877
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:57,720
Yes, sir.

878
00:35:04,160 --> 00:35:04,800
Squad Leader,

879
00:35:05,320 --> 00:35:05,960
this is bad.

880
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:08,520
There's a front and a back command post.

881
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:10,840
Which one is the real assembly area?

882
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:13,920
The two command posts aren't the biggest problem.

883
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:17,040
The biggest problem is that the front and back of the mountain

884
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:18,920
are two completely different routes.

885
00:35:19,960 --> 00:35:22,680
If we choose wrong, we'll have to detour.

886
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:24,240
Then we'll definitely lose.

887
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,600
How about I take some men closer to check?

888
00:35:27,120 --> 00:35:27,920
Don't rush.

889
00:35:29,760 --> 00:35:31,480
Both command posts

890
00:35:32,320 --> 00:35:34,480
have defensive personnel set up.

891
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:36,240
Why get so close?

892
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:37,880
To get ourselves caught?

893
00:35:38,480 --> 00:35:40,520
We can't just send the commander two locations.

894
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,920
Based on my comprehensive analysis,

895
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:46,640
the command post in front of the mountain

896
00:35:46,680 --> 00:35:48,520
is clearly a bluff.

897
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:49,360
It's fake.

898
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:52,560
The command post behind the mountain

899
00:35:52,960 --> 00:35:55,840
is more hidden and in a valley.

900
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:57,800
It should be real.

901
00:35:58,280 --> 00:35:58,600
Huzi,

902
00:35:59,680 --> 00:36:01,320
quickly send the coordinates of the back command post

903
00:36:01,320 --> 00:36:02,040
to the commander.

904
00:36:02,520 --> 00:36:03,040
Understood.

905
00:36:06,720 --> 00:36:08,280
Commander, I have good news.

906
00:36:08,640 --> 00:36:08,920
Speak.

907
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:10,840
The 1st Battalion hasn't set off yet.

908
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:12,760
Looks like they're confused by Deputy Commander Liang's

909
00:36:12,760 --> 00:36:14,400
dual command posts.

910
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:16,800
In terms of tactical proficiency,

911
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:19,200
the 1st Battalion definitely can't handle it.

912
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,800
But let's not drop our guard.

913
00:36:21,080 --> 00:36:21,960
Since Deputy Army Commander Liang

914
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:23,560
only set a single target for us,

915
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:25,400
it means on the road ahead,

916
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:27,880
there are other obstacles and tests

917
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:28,680
waiting for us.

918
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:30,040
Keep a close eye on their movements.

919
00:36:30,520 --> 00:36:30,880
Yes, sir.

920
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:34,720
Report! Received front-line intel from Wu Dongsheng.

921
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:41,400
All right.

922
00:36:41,840 --> 00:36:42,320
Battalion Commander,

923
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:45,480
I don't think Wu Dongsheng's analysis is fully accurate.

924
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:47,360
Should we send a few guys to double-check?

925
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,640
Trust those you use, don't use those you doubt.

926
00:36:50,280 --> 00:36:50,920
We'll follow Wu Dongsheng.

927
00:36:51,520 --> 00:36:52,120
Yes, sir.

928
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:54,560
First Battalion!

929
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:55,480
Sir!

930
00:36:55,480 --> 00:36:56,240
Move out!

931
00:36:56,240 --> 00:36:57,120
Yes, sir!

932
00:37:18,720 --> 00:37:20,960
The First Battalion's convoy has clearly veered off course.

933
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:23,280
Ling Jun.

934
00:37:23,960 --> 00:37:26,240
Your tone clearly shows bias.

935
00:37:28,080 --> 00:37:29,800
No, I just feel it's a shame.

936
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:31,600
The unit took the wrong path right from the start.

937
00:37:31,600 --> 00:37:33,120
How are they going to fight the rest of the battle?

938
00:37:33,720 --> 00:37:34,720
Isn't that perfect?

939
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:36,840
It's time to test the commander.

940
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:45,720
This is bad.

941
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:48,800
Sir, it's raining on-site.

942
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:50,760
I see it.

943
00:37:53,080 --> 00:37:53,760
All companies, attention.

944
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:55,200
While maintaining your speed,

945
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:56,480
watch out for slippery roads tonight.

946
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:57,520
Drive carefully.

947
00:37:58,240 --> 00:37:59,240
All companies, acknowledge.

948
00:37:59,680 --> 00:38:01,200
Copy.

949
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:06,120
Report, Commander.

950
00:38:06,240 --> 00:38:07,920
Due to a misjudgment by the First Battalion's recon squad,

951
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:09,400
they provided the wrong target coordinates.

952
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:12,160
After entering the mountains, the First Battalion is heading toward a dummy target.

953
00:38:12,640 --> 00:38:14,760
Commander, our chances of winning are very high this time.

954
00:38:15,080 --> 00:38:16,200
Notify the support company.

955
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:18,000
Send engineers

956
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:22,000
to set up roadblocks on the First Battalion's return route.

957
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:23,960
You want to cut off their retreat.

958
00:38:24,240 --> 00:38:26,000
If we are going to win, let's secure it.

959
00:38:26,720 --> 00:38:27,600
Just in case.

960
00:38:28,080 --> 00:38:28,680
Yes, sir.

961
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:42,120
That Second Battalion is way too ruthless.

962
00:38:57,400 --> 00:38:59,120
Isn't that the 1st Battalion's recon squad?

963
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:00,320
They're back again.

964
00:39:02,120 --> 00:39:03,920
It's all my fault. My fault. My fault.

965
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:05,120
Wrong way.

966
00:39:05,520 --> 00:39:06,960
Quick, send the location in front of the mountain.

967
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:07,440
Yes, sir.

968
00:39:09,880 --> 00:39:11,080
Looks like they realized their mistake.

969
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:15,080
Too bad they realized it too late.

970
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,560
Their retreat route has been cut off.

971
00:39:18,560 --> 00:39:20,440
Have you set up the roadblock for the 2nd Battalion?

972
00:39:20,840 --> 00:39:21,880
Rest assured, Staff Officer Liang.

973
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:23,440
They'll run into our roadblock any minute now.

974
00:39:31,720 --> 00:39:33,760
We've cut off the 1st Battalion's retreat route.

975
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:36,280
Tell the support company not to rush back just yet.

976
00:39:37,520 --> 00:39:38,240
Tell them

977
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:42,320
to keep a close eye on the 1st Battalion at the roadblock.

978
00:39:42,600 --> 00:39:43,320
Yes, sir.

979
00:39:53,240 --> 00:39:54,240
What's going on? What's going on?

980
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:55,320
Why did we stop?

981
00:39:56,240 --> 00:39:57,160
Reporting, Commander.

982
00:39:57,640 --> 00:39:59,160
There's a roadblock ahead.

983
00:39:59,520 --> 00:40:01,040
There's a roadblock ahead.

984
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:09,920
That Wu Dongsheng...

985
00:40:10,080 --> 00:40:11,840
He does more harm than good.

986
00:40:12,120 --> 00:40:13,440
We shouldn't have given such an important task

987
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,480
to his recon squad.

988
00:40:15,120 --> 00:40:16,400
Now we look like complete idiots.

989
00:40:17,680 --> 00:40:19,640
Commander, please give your orders.

990
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:20,640
Report.

991
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:24,200
Commander.

992
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:25,840
We've received a message from the scouts.

993
00:40:26,200 --> 00:40:27,680
Jiang Shengqiang cut off our retreat.

994
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:28,840
Can we clear the obstacle?

995
00:40:29,120 --> 00:40:29,920
We can clear it,

996
00:40:30,160 --> 00:40:32,160
but it will take at least two hours.

997
00:40:32,680 --> 00:40:34,600
Judging by the 2nd Battalion's current speed,

998
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:36,120
if we turn back to clear it,

999
00:40:36,120 --> 00:40:37,320
we will definitely lose.

1000
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:40,360
I can't believe Jiang Shengqiang is using tactics now.

1001
00:40:41,040 --> 00:40:42,840
He didn't lose to us those times for nothing.

1002
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:44,040
He has made some progress.

1003
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:45,200
Commander,

1004
00:40:45,560 --> 00:40:47,400
how can you still smile at a time like this?

1005
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:48,720
We need to think of a way out quickly.

1006
00:40:48,720 --> 00:40:49,920
Panicking won't help us now.

1007
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:53,600
Map.

1008
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:58,160
This is the stone bridge marked on the map.

1009
00:40:58,560 --> 00:41:01,440
It's the shortest valley in the mountain range.

1010
00:41:02,160 --> 00:41:03,000
Squad Leader,

1011
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:04,960
not to mention the bridge is broken now,

1012
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:06,320
I think even if it were intact,

1013
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,400
with this width,

1014
00:41:07,600 --> 00:41:09,280
it'd be hard for our heavy gear to pass.

1015
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:10,320
Stop being so pessimistic.

1016
00:41:10,680 --> 00:41:14,800
Now quickly send the bridge's location, condition,

1017
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:16,240
and the surrounding situation

1018
00:41:16,240 --> 00:41:17,640
as a message to the Commander.

1019
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:18,240
Yes, sir.

1020
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:20,760
The Commander will judge for himself.

1021
00:41:21,640 --> 00:41:23,080
What's the 1st Battalion's situation now?

1022
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:24,120
We just received word

1023
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:25,800
that the 1st Battalion noticed their mistake.

1024
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:27,160
They should be turning back right now.

1025
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:29,040
Do we have a backup plan?

1026
00:41:30,520 --> 00:41:31,880
We have two routes to choose from.

1027
00:41:32,280 --> 00:41:34,200
One is a simple mountain path.

1028
00:41:34,440 --> 00:41:36,040
After passing through this path,

1029
00:41:36,200 --> 00:41:37,840
there is an impassable valley.

1030
00:41:38,160 --> 00:41:39,080
Unless we build a bridge.

1031
00:41:39,480 --> 00:41:40,280
The other route,

1032
00:41:40,480 --> 00:41:42,440
though easier to travel, is a detour.

1033
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:44,720
Which plan is faster?

1034
00:41:44,920 --> 00:41:45,920
Under normal circumstances,

1035
00:41:46,120 --> 00:41:47,880
building a bridge is definitely faster than detouring.

1036
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:49,440
But it's raining now,

1037
00:41:49,960 --> 00:41:51,760
so building a bridge poses a huge safety risk.

1038
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:54,240
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo values safety the most.

1039
00:41:54,640 --> 00:41:56,720
So if the 1st Battalion turns back to clear obstacles,

1040
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:58,640
the time spent and the time for our detour

1041
00:41:58,640 --> 00:41:59,520
will actually be about the same.

1042
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:01,040
After comprehensive analysis, I believe

1043
00:42:01,200 --> 00:42:02,840
speeding up on the detour is safer.

1044
00:42:04,320 --> 00:42:04,960
As for the 1st Battalion,

1045
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:06,880
do they have a backup plan?

1046
00:42:07,280 --> 00:42:08,800
We have three choices right now.

1047
00:42:09,720 --> 00:42:11,520
First is turning back the way we came.

1048
00:42:11,680 --> 00:42:12,960
But just as Staff Officer Hu said,

1049
00:42:13,120 --> 00:42:13,880
we don't have enough time.

1050
00:42:14,080 --> 00:42:15,160
Second is taking a detour.

1051
00:42:15,200 --> 00:42:16,840
But that will take even more time.

1052
00:42:16,880 --> 00:42:18,600
The third is right here,

1053
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:20,800
Fengyao Valley.

1054
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:21,320
Right.

1055
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:23,160
Notify Wu Dongsheng immediately

1056
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:24,760
to scout Fengyao Valley quickly.

1057
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:25,200
Yes, sir.

1058
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:35,840
Battalion Commander.

1059
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:37,280
What a coincidence.

1060
00:42:37,480 --> 00:42:39,320
Wu Dongsheng's squad is in Fengyao Valley right now.

1061
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:39,960
Good.

1062
00:42:40,240 --> 00:42:41,760
Now that's the First Battalion's recon squad leader.

1063
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:43,280
Report back immediately if there's any news.

1064
00:42:43,320 --> 00:42:43,720
Yes, sir!

1065
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:48,360
Battalion Commander.

1066
00:42:49,320 --> 00:42:50,560
The stone bridge in Fengyao Valley is broken.

1067
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:51,480
Broken?
